        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2644614?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Spec: <a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/web-smart-card/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wicg.github.io/web-smart-card/</a></li>\n<li>Explainer: <a href=\"https://github.com/WICG/web-smart-card/blob/main/README.md\">https://github.com/WICG/web-smart-card/blob/main/README.md</a></li>\n<li>Chrome:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@intenttoship.dev@bsky.brid.gy/115304857193715163\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mastodon.social/@intenttoship.dev@bsky.brid.gy/115304857193715163</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/dtUIO4sOxwA/m/VZo_sqgKAgAJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/dtUIO4sOxwA/m/VZo_sqgKAgAJ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/6411735804674048\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/6411735804674048</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Firefox: ?</li>\n<li>Safari: ?</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/Fyrd/caniuse/issues/7400",
            "title": "Add Web Smart Card API",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-15T21:27:14.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-10-02T17:22:37.000Z",
            "author": {
