        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2644614?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@holger@hellinger.wtf/115260382335808586\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mastodon.social/@holger@hellinger.wtf/115260382335808586</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CSS gets smarter: with typed arithmetic (Chrome 140+) you can finally mix units in math cleanly. No more hacks to strip units. Now calc(10em / 1px) just works. Great for typography, layout, responsive scaling. Browser understands unit types and does the checks for you.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://css-tricks.com/css-typed-arithmetic/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://css-tricks.com/css-typed-arithmetic/</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Spec, part of CSS Values and Units Module Level 4: <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/css-values-4/#calc-type-checking\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.w3.org/TR/css-values-4/#calc-type-checking</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/4740780497043456\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/4740780497043456</a></li>\n<li>Intent to Ship: <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/A5APTVmqntU/m/J0ih1a4wAwAJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/A5APTVmqntU/m/J0ih1a4wAwAJ</a></li>\n<li>Shipping in 140</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Firefox: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3149743810\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1252\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1252/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1252\">mozilla/standards-positions#1252</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Safari: \"Implemented in WebKit\", but found no other link</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">WPT: <a href=\"https://wpt.fyi/results/css/css-values/getComputedStyle-calc-mixed-units-003.html?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wpt.fyi/results/css/css-values/getComputedStyle-calc-mixed-units-003.html?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
