        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133189?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Just wanted to add <code class=\"notranslate\">hidden=until-found</code> has been added to Safari on July 7, 2025 via this pull request:<a href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/47684\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/WebKit/WebKit/pull/47684/hovercard\">Enable hidden=until-found in Safari Technology Preview #47684</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'm running Safari 26 currently; <code class=\"notranslate\">hidden=until-found</code> is behind a feature flag.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/Fyrd/caniuse/issues/7356",
            "title": "hidden=until-found added to Safari",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-14T05:34:39.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-02T20:38:48.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "alwillis",
                "url": "https://github.com/alwillis"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/515525?u=266b38ed1b35fecf38b76beec74bb4a296715c68&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">All of these fancy iOS26 liquid glass demos rely on backdrop-filter: url(). See: <a href=\"https://frontendmasters.com/blog/liquid-glass-on-the-web/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://frontendmasters.com/blog/liquid-glass-on-the-web/</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It's not supported on <a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=245510\" rel=\"nofollow\">Safari</a> or <a href=\"https://connect.mozilla.org/t5/ideas/support-svg-filters-in-backdrop-filter-for-advanced-glass/idi-p/98453\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firefox</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A search for \"Backdrop Filter\" brings up a listing for <a href=\"https://caniuse.com/css-backdrop-filter\" rel=\"nofollow\">the basic effects</a>, but that's not helpful when figuring out what these liquid glass demos will run on.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thank you for this wonderful resource.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/Fyrd/caniuse/issues/7354",
            "title": "Add backdrop-filter: url()",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-14T05:34:23.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-07-30T05:52:12.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "RonAmadeo",
                "url": "https://github.com/RonAmadeo"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30958850?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">seems like there's no page yet for the new <code class=\"notranslate\">alpha</code> attribute on <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;input type=\"color\" alpha&gt;</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2388847339\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10456\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/whatwg/html/pull/10456/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10456\">whatwg/html#10456</a><br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3057791669\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1230\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1230/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1230\">mozilla/standards-positions#1230</a></p>",
