            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2644614?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">inspired by the state of HTML 2025:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://maps4html.org/MapML-Specification/spec/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://maps4html.org/MapML-Specification/spec/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Maps4HTML/MapML-Proposal\">https://github.com/Maps4HTML/MapML-Proposal</a></li>\n</ul>",
