        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1166978?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Draft was accepted 3 months ago:<br>\n<a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-5/#random\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-5/#random</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">No known completed implementations yet.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Gecko:<br>\n<a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1836588\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1836588</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Blink:<br>\n<a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/413385732\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/413385732</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/Fyrd/caniuse/issues/7349",
            "title": "CSS value random()",
            "date_modified": "2026-01-05T23:58:24.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-07-23T06:10:52.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Mardeg",
